A '''Drip''' is an alternate version of the Dip that rolls around in diagonal directions and can travel over flooded pits. They are also spawned by [[Splurt]]s upon death and by [[Clog]] during battle.
{{clear}}{{dlc clear}}

== Notes ==
* {{i|Dirty Mind}} will convert all Dips to [[Familiar#Dips|Dip Familiars]]. Dips, Corns and Brownie Corns are turned into their respective familiar counterparts while Drips are converted into regular Dip familiars and Big Corns into Corny Dip familiars.

