== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|a}} The Corn has the lowest health of any enemy in the game, tied with the [[Fly]].
* Dips are likely a reference to [[zelda:Gel|Gels]], enemies from [[wikipedia:The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past|''The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past'']], as they have nearly the same movement patterns.
* The name of the Dips is a pun on the term "dipshit", due to their names (Dips) and the fact that they are living fecal matter.

